# Generated research documents (regenerated by an operator command each run).
# The script and its tests are tracked; its daily output is not, because a
# worksheet rebuilt every run would put a diff in every commit.
docs/research/M1_DAILY_REVIEW_PACKET.md

# Generated Research Governor outputs
docs/research/RESEARCH_GOVERNOR_REPORT_latest.md
cache/research/research_governor_latest.json

# Generated research reports (rewritten by a scheduled cycle on every run).
# The writers and their tests stay tracked; their output does not, because a
# report rebuilt twice a day puts a diff in every commit. The files stay on
# disk and are still read by the operator — they are simply not versioned.
#   DAILY_ALPHA_RADAR_REPORT      nightly + premarket
#   NIGHTLY_OPERATOR_SUMMARY      nightly
#   OPTIONS_CHAIN_SNAPSHOT_*      options snapshot timer, 15:45 ET Mon-Fri
#   PARTICIPATION_BOTTLENECK_AUDIT  midday Mon-Fri
#   SOCIAL_ATTENTION_FORWARD_RESULTS  nightly + the social cron
docs/research/DAILY_ALPHA_RADAR_REPORT.md
docs/research/NIGHTLY_OPERATOR_SUMMARY.md
docs/research/OPTIONS_CHAIN_SNAPSHOT_HEALTH.md
docs/research/OPTIONS_CHAIN_SNAPSHOT_QUALITY.md
docs/research/PARTICIPATION_BOTTLENECK_AUDIT.md
docs/research/SOCIAL_ATTENTION_FORWARD_RESULTS.md
